include translations/13016_keite

Bind Npc 13016 Zone 21

On greeting
    Say "I'm [Trainer] Kate. I'm in charge of all things related to Familiar| You can hatch Familiar eggs or change names with the [Familiar Name Change Certificate]. Would you like to try it?"

On topics
    If quest 78 is completed
        Topic "Familiar Hatching and transform" goto hatching
        Topic "Use Voucher" goto vouchers

On hatching
    Open familiar panel

On vouchers
    Say if_you_bring_a
    Topic "Exchange Magic Bag" goto magic_bag
    Topic "Exchange Automatic Loot" goto automatic_looting
    Topic "I'll just go." goto close

On magic_bag
    If player has 800440000
        Trade 1 of 800440000 for 1 of 700011001 for 30 days
    Else
        Say "You don't have a [Voucher for Magic Bag]."
        Topic "Confirm" goto close

On automatic_looting
    If player has 800450000
        Trade 1 of 800450000 for 1 of 700012000 for 30 days
    Else
        Say "You don't have a [Voucher for Automatic Looting]."
        Topic "Confirm" goto close
